# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the reverb's types switched under a steady sound (the LFO's sends
# and the Swell off), mix 50. Hall, then Shimmer: its octave washes in over 8 s and out over 6, and only the halo
# changes, the room is the Hall's (Evan, 2026-11-10: "it should wash in and out"). Then Cathedral to the Hall: a
# type's crossfade is 200 ms (at 50 the level jumped up to 6 dB leaving the Cathedral). Not a test of its own (no
# expectations).
notips
phones 1
set 55 0
set 14 0
set 17 0
set 35 0
set 38 0
tap PLAY
set 63 50
set 64 1
wav reverb-types.wav
wait 6000
set 64 4
wait 14000
set 64 1
wait 9000
set 64 2
wait 5000
set 64 1
wait 4000
